  "merits": "Surah al-Mulk: Al-Kulayni has reported Imam Muhammad al-Baqir (‘a) as saying, “Surah al-Mulk is the preventing Surah; it prevents from the chastisement in graves etc.”\n\nVerse that survived the sea: Imam al-Baqir (‘a) is also reported to have said: A copy of the Holy Qur’an fell in a sea. When it was taken out, the entire inscription had gone except this holy verse.\n\nDua with an open Qur'an: Shaykh al-Kulayni has also reported this instruction from Zurarah."
